2019Aerial Photography and Li DAR Project.
Pleasefind the attached contract for the above referenced Agreement.This Agreement outlines the
terms and conditions of an agreement between the City of Cheyenne (on behalf of the Cheyenne
Laramie County GIS Cooperative) and Aero-Graphic, Inc.on the gathering of aerial imagery and
LiD ARdat a for use with the City's and Laramie County's GIS system.The total costof the project
is $130,000.This will be paid for jointly by the City, the Board of Public Utilities (BOPU),
Laramie County, and the Cheyenne Metropolitan Planning Organization(MPO).The City will be
contributing$38,452.
