```text
AttachmentA-Scope of Work
Ground Control
Ground control survey, including LiDAR-specific targets, to support the aerial photography and
Li DAR deliverable s listed below.Approximately22points, willrecover andrefresh, orreplaceas
necessary, points from the 2014 flight.The image files shallbe geo processed and delivered in
Wyoming State Plane East Zone, NAD83(CORS96) U.S.survey feet.
Aerial Photography
V excel Ultra Cam Eagle Digital Image acquisition at6”GSD
GNSs/IMU trajectory post-processing
Radiometric processing of stereo imagery; samples will be submitted for approval of color
balance, density, contrast, etc.
Analytical Aero triangulation
Tilt will not exceed four degreesfor any photographic frame and will average not more than two
degreesfor any ten consecutive frames.Relative tilt exceeding six degrees between any two
successive framesmay be cause for rejecting that portion of theflight lines.
Crab angle as measured from the average line of flight will not exceed five degrees.The course
heading differential between anytwo successive exposures will not exceed five degrees.
The project area will be collected when the sun angle is not less than 40°. On a cloud free or
overcast day.No cloud shadows should be apparent.
RGBI ortho rectified imagery at 0.5'GSD in LZW Compressed TIFF/TFW and overallSID/SDW
formats.
Cells in tiles with no collected data shall be given a No Data value.
Acquisition specifications andflight plan included below
Aerial Photography acquisition is to be undertaken in snow-free, leaf-off conditions. Owner and
Provider will consult together and agree on an acceptable acquisition timeframe given the conditions
that present themselves in Spring 2019.An alternate flying season in Fall2019 maybe considered if
conditions are not conducive to a Spring acquisition.
LIDAR
Optech Galaxy PRIME Li DAR acquisition at 2ppsm
·
GNSS/IMU trajectory post-processing
·
LiDAR data calibration to LAS 1.2
·
Bare earth data classification to LAS 1.2
Control(absolute)accuracy report
Technical Project Report detailing acquisition, processing methodology and results
Acquisition specifications and flight plan included below
Li DAR acquisition maybe undertaken any time after execution of this contract when snow-free
conditions are present and when clouds are not between the aircraft and the ground.Lingering snow
on north faces and in tree shadows may be acceptable but approval of Owner is required.
Total Price$130,000.00
```

